<https://w3id.org/eudpp/standard/sustainability/142371> a eudpp:SustainabilityStandard ;
  dct:description "The Organic Agriculture Standards of the Vietnam Organic Agriculture Association (VOAA) (TCCS-VOAA.V1 2021) is a fundamental standard developed by VOAA based on the Vietnamese organic standards of PGS Vietnam that have been recognized by IFOAM and referenced according to the basic standards of IFOAM and the National Standard TCVN 11041-2017 on production and processing of organic products issued by the Ministry of Science and Technology on December 29, 2017." ;
