<https://w3id.org/eudpp/standard/sustainability/145236> a eudpp:SustainabilityStandard ;
  dct:description "The PGS Vietnam Organic Standards for Producers is a set of standards developed in the project ADDA-VNFU: \"Developing a production and market framework for organic agriculture in Vietnam\" (2005-2012) in the context there were no organic standards and policies to promote organic agriculture that time. The PGS standards with reference to IFOAM Basic Standards and standard 10 TCN 602 -2006 issued by MARD in 2006, being updated according to National Organic Agriculture standard TCVN11041- 2017. PGS standards applicable to producers includes crop, animal husbandry and processing. These standards enable PGS Vietnam to guide farmers in compliance, organize participatory monitoring and certification for smallholder farmers to produce organic products for consumption." ;
  dct:created "2022-06-17"^^xsd:date ;
  dct:issued "2008"^^xsd:gYear ;
  dct:relation <https://vietnamorganic.vn/index.php/vi/news/chung-nhan-pgs/tieu-chuan-huu-co-pgs-viet-nam-lan-3-8-2018-42.html> ;
  dct:source <https://www.standardsmap.org/en/factsheet/145236> ;
  dct:title "Vietnam PGS Organic Standard" ;
