<https://w3id.org/eudpp/standard/sustainability/15684> a eudpp:SustainabilityStandard ;
  dct:description "KAGfreiland is a non-profit organization founded in 1972. It is committed to improving animal welfare in husbandry practices. KAGfreiland conducts campaigns and research projects to point out animal friendly alternatives to intensive animal husbandry. Its organic label is one fo the strictest animal husbandry guidelines in Switzerland." ;
