<https://w3id.org/eudpp/standard/sustainability/276> a eudpp:SustainabilityStandard ;
  dct:description "The Ethiopian Horticulture Producer and Exporters Association (EHPEA) is a non governmental, not-for-profit organization and was established in 2002. Currently EHPEA consists of 96 members.The EHPEA Code of Practice for Sustainable Flower Production document sets out a framework for sustainable practices on flower farms in Ethiopia for exporters." ;
