<https://w3id.org/eudpp/standard/sustainability/370> a eudpp:SustainabilityStandard ;
  dct:description "All requirements of this standard are generic and are intended to be applicable to all organizations in the food chain regardless of size and complexity. This includes organizations directly involved in one or more steps of the food chain. Guidelines on the application of this standard in all organizations are contained in the standard for halal food certification rules." ;
