<https://w3id.org/eudpp/standard/sustainability/403> a eudpp:SustainabilityStandard ;
  dct:description "Agricultura Sustentable Certificada (ASC) is a Quality Management System (QMS) that aims to demonstrate the benefits of the non-tillage system and share and spread the principles of sustainable, profitable and highly productive agriculture. ASC provides farmers with the tools and knowledge to improve agricultural practices and farm management, and consumers to know how their food is produced.." ;
  dct:issued "1989"^^xsd:gYear ;
