<https://w3id.org/eudpp/standard/sustainability/420> a eudpp:SustainabilityStandard ;
  dct:description "The ISCC PLUS system is built upon a set of obligatory basic requirements. These are amongst others the requirements on sustainability of the production area (ISCC PLUS 202) and the requirements on the chain of custody (traceability: ISCC PLUS 203; mass balance: ISCC PLUS 204-01, physical separation: ISCC PLUS 204-02). Additionally, there are voluntary add-ons that exceed the obligatory sustainability requirements. Companies can choose these add-ons as voluntary additional modules in order to prove compliance to a specific matter, e.g. specific biodiversity measures or low greenhouse gas emission." ;
  dct:issued "2006"^^xsd:gYear ;
  dct:relation <https://www.iscc-system.org/process/iscc-documents-at-a-glance/> ;
  dct:source <https://www.standardsmap.org/en/factsheet/420> ;
  dct:title "ISCC PLUS - Voluntary Add-ons" ;
