<https://w3id.org/eudpp/standard/sustainability/45> a eudpp:SustainabilityStandard ;
  dct:description "LEAF Marque is a leading global assurance system recognising more sustainably farmed products. It stands for more environmental sustainability and is held by farm businesses which meet the rigorous standards of sustainable farming practice. LEAF Marque certified businesses have been independently verified against the robust LEAF Marque Standard." ;
