  dct:description "The Responsible Alpaca Standard is owned and managed by Textile Exchange. The Responsible Alpaca Standard (RAS) is an international, voluntary standard that addresses animal welfare in the alpaca supply chain and chain of custody of alpaca fiber material from certified farms to the final product." ;
