  dct:relation <http://fairmined.org/>, <http://www.fairmined.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/Fairmined-assurance-system-doc-1.pdf>, <https://fairmined.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/Mechanism-for-pilot-testing-of-Fairmined-Standard-1.pdf>, <https://fairmined.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Specific-Terms-of-Reference-Fairmined-Standard-Committee-2.0.pdf>, <https://fairmined.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/Selecci%C3%B3n-y-aprobaci%C3%B3n-de-firmas-de-auditor%C3%ADa.pdf>, <https://fairmined.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/Fairmined-certification-procedures.pdf>, <https://www.responsiblemines.org/en/>, <https://www.responsiblemines.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/ARM-Complaints-Procedures-2.0-2017-final.pdf>, <https://www.responsiblemines.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/ARM-Standards-Procedures-3.0-2017-final.pdf>, <https://www.responsiblemines.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/Doc-explicativo-cuota-de-desarrollo_Fairmined-Development-Fee-2017-final.pdf> ;
