<https://w3id.org/eudpp/standard/sustainability/535> a eudpp:SustainabilityStandard ;
  dct:description "The Sustainable Farming Assurance Programme is a verification programme for the production of arable commodities, especially those used for feed. The programme is operational in Brasil and will become operational in Argentina in 2018. Further expansion is at the moment not forseen. " ;
