<https://w3id.org/eudpp/standard/sustainability/583> a eudpp:SustainabilityStandard ;
  dct:description "The \"Sustainable Cereal and Oilseed\" standard is the result of the development of a process with different stakeholders, involving companies and representatives from the worlds of agriculture and industry. The requirement of this standard stems from the desire to produce cereals, oilseeds and their derivatives according to the best practices known, to ensure a fully sustainable product." ;
  dct:issued "1990"^^xsd:gYear ;
  dct:relation <https://www.csqa.it/CSQA/Download/Regolamenti-CSQA> ;
