  dct:description "Sustainable Forestry Initiative is a sustainability initiative in standards, conservation, community, and education. As an independent, non-profit organization, SFI collaborates with diverse network to provide solutions to local and global sustainability challenges. SFI works with the forest sector, brand owners, conservation groups, resource professionals, landowners, educators, local communities, Indigenous Peoples, governments, and universities." ;
  dct:issued "1994"^^xsd:gYear ;
  dct:relation <https://forests.org/new-sfi-2022-standards-updates/> ;
  dct:source <https://www.standardsmap.org/en/factsheet/63> ;
  dct:title "Sustainable Forestry Initiative - SFI" ;
