<https://w3id.org/eudpp/standard/sustainability/708> a eudpp:SustainabilityStandard ;
  dct:description "The standard integrates both management and performance criteria and is based on leading international sustainability and CSR standards and guidelines. The Travelife Certified award  (stage 3) is the most comprehensive and rigorous of the three stages (Stage 1: Travelife engaged and Stage 2 Travelife Partner award). Based on compliance with the Travelife Certified criteria, which is desk audited by the coach, the company can request an independent third-party assessment. The company will be evaluated during an on-site audit based on international auditing standards. Upon compliance it will be awarded the Travelife Certified status as proof of internationally recognized high sustainability performance." ;
  dct:issued "2007"^^xsd:gYear ;
  dct:relation <https://www.travelife.info/includes/download_manager.php?module=website&file=290228> ;
  dct:source <https://www.standardsmap.org/en/factsheet/708> ;
  dct:title "Travelife Certified standard for travel companies" ;
