  dct:description "The CSE certification is an intersectoral certification for companies and sustainability-oriented organizations. CSE stands for Certified Sustainable Economics. The CSE label is a quality label for products of a certified sustainable company. The CSE standard is reviewed on a regular basis and evolved continuously." ;
