<https://w3id.org/eudpp/standard/sustainability/8052> a eudpp:SustainabilityStandard ;
  dct:description "TS SC 410 for \"products system in tanneries\": traceability of raw materials (hides/skins) as they enter the Organization is mapped and managed. The scheme is applicable to a system of products (hides) produced and/or handled by the Organization based on those same raw materials.   The product system may include the entire range of products produced and/or handled by the Organization, or a more limited set of products, and with certain common characteristics (e.g. animal type, intended use) Once the product system has been defined as the object of certification, the countries of origin of the raw materials may be different and, with respect to purchases made, exclusions of origin or of purchase orders within the required period of the analysis are never allowed.  This Specification is applicable to Organizations of any size and type, regardless of which and how many activities they perform within the leather industry." ;
  dct:created "2023-07-31"^^xsd:date ;
  dct:issued "1994"^^xsd:gYear ;
  dct:relation <https://www.icec.it/en/certifications/product-economic-sustainability/leather-traceability-certification> ;
  dct:source <https://www.standardsmap.org/en/factsheet/8052> ;
  dct:title "ICEC TS 410" ;
