<https://w3id.org/eudpp/standard/sustainability/8089> a eudpp:SustainabilityStandard ;
  dct:description "Scheme owner: Cooxupé Name of scheme: Gerações - Cooxupé Sustainability Protocol The Gerações program was developed by Cooxupé with the support of SCS Global Services (\"SCS\"), a global third-party certification body with more than 40 years of experience in environmental, sustainability and food quality certification.   The Cooxupé Cooxupé has over 20,000 members, 97% of whom are small producers who make a living from family farming. The Cooperative receives coffee produced in over 330 municipalities in its area of ​​operation, located in the South of Minas Gerais, Cerrado Mineiro, Matas de Minas and Vale do Rio Pardo (in the state of São Paulo). With a view to diversifying its business, Cooxupé also has projects such as its own roasting, assistance in the production and sale of corn, a feed factory, laboratories for soil analysis, geoprocessing, among other investments. In addition, the Cooperative has, over the years, expanded markets such as specialty and certified coffees. Currently, Cooxupé is made up of 49 business units, including: the Head Office (in Guaxupé), centers, branches, advanced units, service stations and the export office in Santos. The Cooperative also has warehouses and the Japy Industrial Complex, a state-of-the-art logistics enterprise. https://www.cooxupe.com.br/quem-somos/" ;
  dct:created "2024-10-18"^^xsd:date ;
  dct:issued "1932"^^xsd:gYear ;
  dct:references <https://www.cooxupe.com.br/quem-somos/> ;
  dct:relation <https://www.cooxupe.com.br/protocolo-geracoes-2/> ;
  dct:source <https://www.standardsmap.org/en/factsheet/8089> ;
  dct:title "Gerações" ;
  eudpp:appliesToCountryOfOrigin <https://w3id.org/eudpp/country/BR> ;
  eudpp:appliesToCountryOfOriginCode "BR" ;
  eudpp:appliesToCountryOfOriginStr "Brazil" ;
  eudpp:benchmarkedAfter2022 true ;
  eudpp:benchmarkedBefore2022 true ;
  eudpp:hasThirdPartyVerification false ;
  eudpp:isConsumableLabel true ;
  eudpp:isInternational false ;
  eudpp:isPrivate false ;
  eudpp:isPublic false ;
  eudpp:pillarScoreEthics 26 ;
